static const char *const mp_38_0[] = {
    "# INI File Format",
    "",
    "Understanding ECU definition files.",
    "",
    "## Overview",
    "",
    "INI files define:",
    "- ECU memory layout",
    "- Configuration constants",
    "- Tables and curves",
    "- Output channels",
    "- Gauge configurations",
    "- Menu structure",
    "",
    "## File Structure",
    "",
    "```ini",
    "[MegaTune]",
    "signature = \"speeduino 202310\"",
    "queryCommand = \"Q\"",
    "...",
    "",
    "[Constants]",
    "; Memory layout and defaults",
    "...",
    "",
    "[OutputChannels]",
    "; Real-time data definitions",
    "...",
    "",
    "[TableEditor]",
    "; Table definitions",
    "...",
    "",
    "[GaugeConfigurations]",
    "; Gauge setup",
    "...",
    "",
    "[Menu]",
    "; Menu structure",
    "...",
    "```",
    "",
    "## Key Sections",
    "",
    "### [MegaTune]",
    "ECU identification and commands:",
    "```ini",
    "signature = \"speeduino 202310\"",
    "queryCommand = \"Q\"",
    "versionInfo = \"S\"",
    "```",
    "",
    "### [Constants]",
    "Memory-mapped values:",
    "```ini",
    "page = 1",
    "blockingFactor = 128",
    "reqFuel = scalar, U08, 0, \"ms\", 0.1, 0, 0, 25.5",
    "```",
    "",
    "### [OutputChannels]",
    "Real-time data:",
    "```ini",
    "rpm = scalar, U16, 0, \"RPM\", 1, 0",
    "map = scalar, U16, 2, \"kPa\", 0.1, 0",
    "```",
    "",
    "### [TableEditor]",
    "Table definitions:",
    "```ini",
    "table = veTable1Tbl, veTable1Map, \"VE Table 1\", 1",
    "  xBins = rpmBins, rpm",
    "  yBins = mapBins, map",
    "  zBins = veTable1",
    "```",
    "",
    "## Data Types",
    "",
    "| Type | Size | Range |",
    "|------|------|-------|",
    "| U08 | 1 byte | 0-255 |",
    "| S08 | 1 byte | -128 to 127 |",
    "| U16 | 2 bytes | 0-65535 |",
    "| S16 | 2 bytes | -32768 to 32767 |",
    "| U32 | 4 bytes | 0-4294967295 |",
    "| F32 | 4 bytes | Floating point |",
    "",
    "## Expressions",
    "",
    "Constants can use expressions:",
    "```ini",
    "value = scalar, U08, 0, \"\", 1, 0, 0, { nCylinders * 2 }",
    "```",
    "",
    "Supported operators: `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, `\?:`, `&&`, `||`",
    "",
    "## Menu Definitions",
    "",
    "Define application menus:",
    "```ini",
    "menu = \"Fuel\"",
    "  subMenu = veTable1Tbl, \"VE Table 1\"",
    "  subMenu = reqFuelCalc, \"Required Fuel\"",
    "  subMenu = injCharacteristics, \"Injector Characteristics\"",
    "```",
    "",
    "## Dialog Definitions",
    "",
    "Settings screens are built in the `[UserDefined]` section from named dialogs",
    "referenced by `subMenu` (or embedded via `panel =`):",
    "",
    "```ini",
    "[UserDefined]",
    "dialog = moreIgnitionOptions, \"Ignition Options\"",
    "    field = \"Use Prediction\", use_prediction",
    "    checkbox = \"Use Prediction\", use_prediction, { !use_prediction }",
    "    checkbox = \"Don't use Prediction\", use_prediction, flipValue, { use_prediction }",
    "    slider = \"Prediction filter\", predictionFilter, horizontal, { use_prediction }",
    "```",
    "",
    "Common directives: `field` (labeled constant editor), `checkbox` (bound",
    "toggle), `slider` (range control using the constant's own min/max), `panel`",
    "(embed another dialog), `commandButton`, `settingSelector`, `gauge`,",
    "`indicator`, `runtimeValue`, `table`.",
    "",
    "**Checkbox directives** render as real checkboxes bound to the constant:",
    "checked <-> non-zero by default; the optional `flipValue` token inverts the",
    "sense (checked <-> 0). Brace conditions follow the same convention as fields \342\200\224",
    "a single `{ expression }` enables/disables the control (greyed out, not",
    "hidden), two braces give visibility then enable. Two checkboxes on the same",
    "constant with opposite conditions act as a radio pair, exactly as in",
    "TunerStudio.",
    "",
    "**Slider directives** render as a range control bounded by the constant's",
    "own min/max, committing the written value when the handle is released. The",
    "optional orientation token (`horizontal`/`vertical`) is accepted;",
    "LibreTune renders the control horizontally either way.",
    "",
    "**displayOnlyField directives** are read-only rows. With a constant they show",
    "its current value (for `bits` constants, the option text \342\200\224 e.g. the",
    "configured pin); without one (or with `blankfield`) they render a static",
    "text line, with visibility/enable conditions applied as usual. `#`/`!`",
    "label prefixes style the line as a section header or note.",
    "",
    "**requiresPowerCycle**: constants listed under `[ConstantsExtensions]`",
    "`requiresPowerCycle` show a \"power cycle\" badge in dialogs \342\200\224 the change only",
    "takes effect after the ECU is restarted.",
    "",
    "**topicHelp** inside a dialog definition (`topicHelp = \"https://\342\200\246\"`) is",
    "rendered as an external help link in the dialog header.",
    "",
    "## Gauge Definitions",
    "",
    "Configure gauges:",
    "```ini",
    "[GaugeConfigurations]",
    "rpmGauge = rpm, \"Engine Speed\", \"RPM\", 0, 8000, 300, 600, 6500, 7500",
    "```",
    "",
    "Format: channel, title, units, min, max, lowWarn, lowDanger, highWarn, highDanger",
    "",
    "## Modifying INI Files",
    "",
    "**Warning**: Modifying INI files can cause problems:",
    "- Incorrect offsets corrupt data",
    "- Wrong types cause misreads",
    "- Always backup original",
    "",
    "For custom ECUs:",
    "1. Start from similar existing INI",
    "2. Modify gradually",
    "3. Test each change",
    "4. Document modifications",
    "",
    "## Resources",
    "",
    "- Speeduino INI documentation",
    "- rusEFI INI reference",
    "- MegaSquirt INI format guide",
    "",
};
